<title>USA: Phonetel to acquire Cherokee for $54 mil.</title>
<headline>Phonetel to acquire Cherokee for $54 mil.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>PhoneTel Technologies Inc on Monday said it will acquire Cherokee Communications Inc for $54 million in cash.</p>
<p>The transaction should be completed by January 1997.</p>
<p>Cherokee, of Jacksonville, Texas, currently owns and operates about 13,500 public pay telephones, located principally in Texas, New Mexico, Colorado, Utah and Montana. -- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
